    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3079-8829
    affiliation: Hoff Research
    website: https://hoffresearch.com
abstract: >-
  Record of a closed exploratory study of namespace interference in language models, built on seven
  systems of the 3char dataset. It contains the frozen protocol, the raw responses of three models, the
  pre-registered scorer, a post hoc audit with a three-dimension evaluator, and the decision to close the
  study after finding no robust evidence of the effect.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/brennercruvinel/poc-nsi
keywords:
  - identifiers
  - entity ambiguity
  - language models
  - evaluation
  - inconclusive result
  - audit
